---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

---
<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Forty clients send requests into a red gate that checks whether fewer than 8 requests are in flight. Allowed requests enter a box with 4 running slots and 4 waiting places. Refused requests get a 503 with a Retry-After header of 1 second, answered in milliseconds. In the capture, 276 of 400 were served and 124 turned away.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Bounded concurrency: 8 requests inside, the rest are told to come back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giới hạn đồng thời: 8 request ở trong, còn lại được bảo quay lại sau</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="users" x={60} y={120} size={28} />
    <text x="60" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>40 clients</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>40 client</tspan></text>
    <line x1="100" y1="120" x2="206" y2="120" class="arrow-l" /><polygon points="215,120 206,115 206,125" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="220" y="76" width="170" height="88" class="rbox" />
    <text x="305" y="106" class="r" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>gate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cổng</tspan></text>
    <text x="305" y="128" class="t" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>in_flight < 8 ?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>in_flight < 8 ?</tspan></text>
    <text x="305" y="148" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>p11_shed.py</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p11_shed.py</tspan></text>
    <line x1="390" y1="120" x2="471" y2="120" class="arrow-l" /><polygon points="480,120 471,115 471,125" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="480" y="66" width="360" height="108" class="box" />
    <text x="500" y="90" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>inside: 4 running + 4 waiting</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bên trong: 4 chạy + 4 chờ</tspan></text>
    <rect x="500" y="104" width="64" height="24" class="bar" />
    <rect x="580" y="104" width="64" height="24" class="bar" />
    <rect x="660" y="104" width="64" height="24" class="bar" />
    <rect x="740" y="104" width="64" height="24" class="bar" />
    <rect x="500" y="138" width="64" height="24" class="box" />
    <rect x="580" y="138" width="64" height="24" class="box" />
    <rect x="660" y="138" width="64" height="24" class="box" />
    <rect x="740" y="138" width="64" height="24" class="box" />
    <line x1="305" y1="164" x2="305" y2="223" class="rarrow-l" /><polygon points="305,232 300,223 310,223" class="rarrow" />
    <rect x="170" y="232" width="270" height="48" class="rbox" />
    <text x="305" y="252" class="r" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>503 + Retry-After: 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>503 + Retry-After: 1</tspan></text>
    <text x="305" y="270" class="t" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>answered in milliseconds</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trả lời trong vài mili giây</tspan></text>
    <text x="480" y="262" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>400 requests: 276 served, 124 turned away.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>400 request: 276 được phục vụ, 124 bị từ chối.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Eight is not magic: it is four slots running plus four waiting. Anything beyond that would only add to everybody's wait.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Con số 8 không thần bí: bốn slot đang chạy cộng bốn chỗ chờ. Thêm nữa chỉ làm mọi người chờ lâu hơn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig11 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fig11 .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .fig11 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .fig11 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .fig11 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .fig11 .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig11 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .fig11 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .fig11 .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig11 .rbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .lead { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .fig11 .rline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .fig11 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .rbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .fig11 .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .fig11 .arrow-l { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 .rarrow { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .rarrow-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
